        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F60BRK, Brookshire Single Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf you are as sick of the same old handlesets as we are, then you'll love the Fancy Brookshire Single Cylinder Handleset. It has fantastic detailing that really grants it an old world feel while still seeming perfectly placed in today's modern world. The Single Cylinder Brookshire Handleset features easy installation. It can be installed with just a Phillips Screwdriver. One feature that makes it so easy to install is the fact that the through-bolt slides up and down so it can fit already existing holes. It will fit doors with thicknesses between 1-5/8\" up to 2\" with backsets of either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt is thrown or retracted by a key from the outside or by a thumbturn on the inside. The latch is retracted by a thumbpiece from the outside and by a turn knob on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <a href=\"/products/brookshire-dummy-handleset-schlage-f93brk\"><b>Brookshire Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Brookshire Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5 Grade 1 security.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>All metal chassis for strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>3 screw door frame reinforcer.</li>\r\n<li>C keyway comes packaged with 2 keys.</li>\r\n<li>Outside Trim: Handlesets are solid forged brass; wrought brass trim rings with concealed security inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Inside Trim: are zinc-based plated to match finishes indicated.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit most standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable throughbolt can move up and down 1-1/2\" to fit a variety of pre-existing holes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Single Cylinder Brookshire Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Range of Door Preparation: 4\" to 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Total Height: 18-7/16\" (with 5-1/2\" door prep)</li> \r\n<li>Exterior Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Center to Center Grip Range: adjustable 8-3/8\" to 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Escutcheon Height: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Escutcheon Width: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Grip Escutcheon Width: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Height: 13-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: will fit 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: will fit 1-5/8\" up to 1-3/4\" packaged with extra screws to accommodate 2\" doors</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SCH-BRK-hand-specifications.pdf?v=1704262315\"><b>Schlage Brookshire Exterior Handleset Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish. The Andover Knob is not available in Matte Black. The Avila Lever is not available in Matte Black. The Flair Lever is not available in Matte Black. The Avanti Lever is not available in Bright Brass or Matte Black. The Broadway Lever is not available in Bright Brass or Antique Brass.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Single Cylinder Brookshire Handleset, Schlage F60BRK",
                "description": "Schlage F60BRK, Single Cylinder Brookshire Handleset - If you are as sick of the same old handlesets as we are, then you'll love the Fancy Brookshire Single Cylinder Handleset. It has fantastic detailing that really grants it an old world feel while still seeming perfectly placed in today's modern world. The Single Cylinder Brookshire Handleset features easy installation. It can be installed with just a Phillips Screwdriver. One feature that makes it so easy to install is the fact that the through-bolt slides up and down so it can fit already existing holes. It will fit doors with thicknesses between 1-5/8 inches up to 2 inches with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
